Exit 1, which is the intended failure: the one assertion 'ADR-0066 §2: manifest config.files lists every file of config/' fails with actual 0, expected 2.
- config/ on disk: [compose.yaml, images.lock.json];
- phased manifest.config: {"files": [], "sha256": "3a7ce9a2…"};
